    "construction_note": "The symmetric five-CNOT accumulator sequence s0->s5, s1->s0, s5->s2, s4->s3, and s7->s6, followed by its reverse, exposes a dictionary that needs 41 product injections and three X injections. The lowest-task-ID SAT witness from the clean 512-rank retained-skeleton run was decoded independently into this schedule. This is a verified suffix unitary, not a verified repair of the paper's full S-box circuit.",
